{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1.0.1 Update: Added a new gym live-streaming feature. For details, please refer to the update notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You will play as a contestant in a beauty pageant, ruthlessly beating up your rivals backstage while delivering a flawless performance on stage to claim the crown of the most beautiful lady.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557370/extras/02.png?t=1747638686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sign up for a TV station\u2019s beauty pageant, fight other contestants backstage, and showcase your talents on stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can ruin your rivals\u2019 faces during fights or give them concussions, making it impossible for them to earn high scores when they go on stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can knock out your opponents, then wear darkly humorous masks to impersonate them and create chaos on stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also use stage props to boost your performance score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers various types of equipment, including jewelry, outfits, and hairstyles, allowing free combinations and randomized attributes for a rich gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All equipment can be upgraded infinitely. Failed upgrades will destroy your equipment, but successful upgrades could give you a tremendous advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a character customization system, allowing you to modify various parameters to design your character\u2019s appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Besides participating in beauty pageants, you can also receive job offers from photography studios to shoot alluring photo sessions and earn rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557370/extras/02.png?t=1747638686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rise to the Top Through Fierce Competition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you\u2019ll start by competing in community beauty pageants. By continuously winning, you can advance to national competitions, growing from an unknown girl into a superstar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the tiered mainline competition challenges, you can unlock various levels of invitational pageants. Participate in these events and win to maintain your soaring popularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All competition content is randomly generated. You\u2019ll face different opponents on different stages, ensuring that even with repeated playthroughs, you won\u2019t encounter the same scenarios twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557370/extras/03.png?t=1747638686\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bare-Handed Combat Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3557370/a08c452c1ec9648504358d3a16f162b864641532.jpg"},{"name":"Bouquet Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3557370/64d94b119b53f4fad46f8810ad8c01200e0f8e29.jpg"},{"name":"Lipstick Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3557370/89437d7aff3f952ef1c617069eae8966218007ee.jpg"},{"name":"Baseball Bat Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3557370/159e0c249eccde3c422fbf966be3720e18423ffd.jpg"},{"name":"Electric Guitar Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3557370/be780e3bf0bb7c0763fe0e539e2b918c1cca9332.jpg"},{"name":"Plunger Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st