, you\u2019ll start by competing in community beauty pageants. By continuously winning, you can advance to national competitions, growing from an unknown girl into a superstar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the tiered mainline competition challenges, you can unlock various levels of invitational pageants. Participate in these events and win to maintain your soaring popularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All competition content is randomly generated. You\u2019ll face different opponents on different stages, ensuring that even with repeated playthroughs, you won\u2019t encounter the same scenarios twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557370/extras/03.png?t=1747638686\" /></p>","developers":["AquaStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557370/ce28cd476a98d43a05a970275b9864d08f7d18ff/header.jpg?t=1747638686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130871,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130871/movie480.mp4?t=1747131802","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130871/movie_max.mp4?t=1747131802"},"name":"Promotional Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130871/d5509157b8830b198555b0e75ce3f8831d219670/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747131802","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130871/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747131802","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t